WEBVTT

01:41.640 --> 01:43.120
The Red Fruits are sweet

01:43.200 --> 01:44.360
The wheat is fragrant…

01:44.440 --> 01:45.480
Uncle, over there.

01:45.560 --> 01:48.280
- Tianjing Grass fills the storehouse
- Over here.

01:48.360 --> 01:49.800
The Red Fruits are sweet

01:49.880 --> 01:51.640
The wheat is fragrant

01:51.720 --> 01:54.520
Tianjing Grass fills the storehouse

02:11.000 --> 02:13.240
Can't you chop the filling?
You have greater strength.

02:33.560 --> 02:34.840
Actually, it's my first time
making Meat Dragons.

02:36.120 --> 02:38.200
Don't worry. I've already made it known

02:38.920 --> 02:41.160
that my wife and I will make sure
it's cooked, despite the taste.

02:49.880 --> 02:52.120
Don't add too much of this old dough
or it will turn sour.

02:53.240 --> 02:54.520
I didn't add much.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.440
You are using too much strength.

03:02.520 --> 03:04.320
You have greater strength
than the cook in my army.

03:04.960 --> 03:06.080
You'll make the dough too hard.

03:15.280 --> 03:17.040
You are covering it now?

03:17.120 --> 03:18.200
Did you add alkali water?

03:19.400 --> 03:20.240
Murong Jinghe.

03:20.320 --> 03:21.240
If you don't add alkali water,
it'll turn sour.

03:21.320 --> 03:22.280
Murong Jinghe,

03:22.960 --> 03:24.000
- What?
- go burn the wood.

03:25.840 --> 03:26.680
Burn the wood.

03:28.680 --> 03:29.720
You have greater strength than me.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.480
I just have great strength.

03:32.560 --> 03:34.040
My mother said that I have been strong
since I was a child.

03:34.640 --> 03:36.000
She was always worried

03:36.080 --> 03:37.960
that I would drive away my husband
who we'd get with great effort.

03:38.880 --> 03:41.720
What kind of son-in-law
would your mother like?

03:43.800 --> 03:44.800
He should be nice and have a good temper.

03:44.880 --> 03:46.440
He should be able to help my father
with his work.

03:47.040 --> 03:48.640
He should know how to read and write,

03:49.880 --> 03:51.120
so that he can teach our kids.

03:51.720 --> 03:53.200
He'd better be able to help
with the accounts for the shop.

03:53.280 --> 03:54.840
My father was a rough man.

03:54.920 --> 03:56.640
My mother always complained
that he couldn't keep the books right.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.280
Your mother wasn't looking
for a son-in-law.

03:59.360 --> 04:00.480
It's more like she was hiring a laborer.

04:03.560 --> 04:05.880
What about you?
What kind of husband would you like?

04:06.760 --> 04:07.600
Me?

04:10.760 --> 04:11.600
I haven't thought about it.

04:12.640 --> 04:14.680
As long as my mother could be satisfied.

04:35.200 --> 04:36.400
It's much more delicious
than the dragon meat I cooked.

04:39.280 --> 04:40.120
You are better than me.

04:40.200 --> 04:43.360
Erniu's mother said you can do
needlework and look after children.

04:43.440 --> 04:44.880
She says you are very capable.

04:44.960 --> 04:48.000
My wife, you know martial arts
and can make Meat Dragons.

04:48.080 --> 04:49.320
You're also very capable.

04:56.480 --> 04:57.520
There is flour on your face.

04:59.840 --> 05:01.000
On your hair, too.

05:02.840 --> 05:03.760
I'll clean it.

05:32.120 --> 05:32.960
Let me help you.

05:46.680 --> 05:47.520
What about you?

05:48.920 --> 05:49.760
What?

05:50.560 --> 05:51.400
What

05:53.400 --> 05:55.640
kind of wife would you like?

05:58.680 --> 05:59.920
My wife…

06:03.200 --> 06:04.440
I haven't thought much about it.

06:05.400 --> 06:08.640
At that time,
I had my heart set on going to war

06:09.480 --> 06:10.520
and even made a bold vow

06:11.480 --> 06:13.920
that I would not get married
until I defeated Xiyan.

06:17.240 --> 06:20.680
The Empress must be very worried
about your marriage.

06:22.040 --> 06:22.880
Indeed.

06:23.560 --> 06:26.240
Later, I couldn't refuse
my mother any longer,

06:26.320 --> 06:27.520
so I agreed to get married.

06:28.280 --> 06:29.480
At that time, I thought

06:30.280 --> 06:31.760
I must find someone I didn't like

06:32.400 --> 06:33.840
to be my wife.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.960
Someone you don't like?

06:36.040 --> 06:38.080
Without feelings or love,
there will be no attachments.

06:38.160 --> 06:40.800
Only in this way can I be fearless
and selfless on the battlefield.

06:43.880 --> 06:45.520
Your wife is so pitiful.

06:48.080 --> 06:49.240
However,

06:50.400 --> 06:52.560
later, someone changed my mind.

06:54.480 --> 06:57.400
I now feel that love

06:58.200 --> 07:00.720
is both a weakness and armor.

07:01.840 --> 07:03.680
Having someone you want to protect

07:03.760 --> 07:07.840
gives you the strength
to survive on the battlefield.

07:08.640 --> 07:10.400
Regardless of whether I can
go to war in the future,

07:11.000 --> 07:12.440
when choosing a wife,

07:14.080 --> 07:16.000
I want to choose someone I truly love.

07:18.920 --> 07:21.960
Don't you want to ask me
what type of woman I like?

07:24.360 --> 07:25.720
What type of woman

07:27.040 --> 07:28.440
do you like?

07:29.880 --> 07:31.000
I like

07:32.560 --> 07:34.240
a good woman.

07:36.280 --> 07:37.920
She's a good person who would rather
harm herself

07:38.840 --> 07:40.640
than let an innocent suffer.

07:42.640 --> 07:45.480
Her personality is resilient and stubborn.

07:45.560 --> 07:47.000
Once she makes up her mind,

07:47.560 --> 07:49.400
she will never give up.

07:50.200 --> 07:51.320
Her words and actions

07:51.400 --> 07:54.040
are straightforward and sincere.

07:55.240 --> 07:57.520
Her frown and her smile

07:58.560 --> 08:00.720
can easily get to me.

08:05.080 --> 08:08.560
She is the most special woman
in this world.

08:09.360 --> 08:10.560
She knows martial arts,

08:12.080 --> 08:13.000
how to embroider,

08:14.760 --> 08:15.920
and how to make Meat Dragons.

08:30.920 --> 08:31.760
She

08:32.799 --> 08:34.559
won't give in to me on everything.

08:35.960 --> 08:38.159
She can be quite fierce when we argue.

08:40.799 --> 08:44.680
You know I hate to lose the most.

08:47.040 --> 08:50.520
But I'm willing to lose to her
for the rest of my life.

09:01.400 --> 09:04.400
Sir, are the Meat Dragons ready?

09:09.120 --> 09:10.240
Yes.

09:21.160 --> 09:22.640
Brat,

09:23.640 --> 09:24.600
you really picked a good time.

09:24.680 --> 09:27.040
The harvest banquet is about to begin.
Hurry up.

09:38.640 --> 09:39.920
Come on.

09:40.000 --> 09:42.400
- Cheers.
- Cheers!

09:42.480 --> 09:43.840
Bottoms up.

09:43.920 --> 09:45.480
Come on. Bottoms up!

09:48.320 --> 09:49.160
Here.

09:49.920 --> 09:51.240
Here. Try this.

09:52.160 --> 09:53.000
I'll pour you some wine.

09:55.120 --> 09:56.280
Thank you.

10:00.720 --> 10:01.640
Don't talk for now.

10:02.680 --> 10:04.640
I've said all I wanted to say.

10:06.240 --> 10:08.200
Previously, I felt they were strange.

10:08.280 --> 10:09.320
They don't look like siblings.

10:09.400 --> 10:11.400
It turns out the couple had a quarrel.

10:11.480 --> 10:12.760
They reconciled a long time ago.

10:12.840 --> 10:14.920
Couples don't hold grudges
for long, right?

10:15.000 --> 10:15.840
Right.

10:16.640 --> 10:18.320
Wei, Madam.

10:18.400 --> 10:19.320
Take a seat.

10:25.880 --> 10:27.160
Are these Meat Dragons?

10:30.600 --> 10:31.800
Wei,

10:31.880 --> 10:33.520
did you brew the Red Fruit Wine yourself?

10:34.120 --> 10:36.280
Yes. This wine is very sweet. Try it.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.600
- Here.
- Give it to me.

10:50.280 --> 10:51.520
You have a weak spleen and stomach.

10:51.600 --> 10:53.520
When you recover, I'll drink with you.

10:54.080 --> 10:54.920
See?

10:57.720 --> 10:59.320
Big boy, I'll drink to you.

11:00.800 --> 11:02.880
Actually, you have very good taste.

11:02.960 --> 11:05.000
However, she is mine.

11:05.600 --> 11:06.480
You are not allowed
to think about her anymore.

11:10.200 --> 11:11.440
I've come around.

11:11.520 --> 11:13.080
I won't compete with you
for Mei Lin anymore.

11:14.680 --> 11:15.520
You are no match for me.

11:22.840 --> 11:25.440
Sir, Miss, I'll drink to you.

11:25.520 --> 11:28.760
I will repay the life-saving grace
of you two.

11:29.440 --> 11:31.360
- I'll drink up.
- It's the right thing to do.

11:31.440 --> 11:32.760
Yeah.

11:33.400 --> 11:34.280
Good.

11:36.240 --> 11:37.080
Mei Lin,

11:37.160 --> 11:38.600
your husband can make Meat Dragons.

11:38.680 --> 11:40.240
He is really skilled in cooking.

11:41.200 --> 11:43.160
Actually, I didn't make the Meat Dragons.

11:43.240 --> 11:44.480
My wife did.

11:44.560 --> 11:45.720
I only needed to burn the wood.

11:45.800 --> 11:46.640
Look.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.720
Mei Lin, your husband is really nice.

11:48.800 --> 11:51.080
You have the best taste
in choosing a husband.

11:51.160 --> 11:52.760
Madam, she didn't pick me.

11:52.840 --> 11:54.320
My mother-in-law did.

11:54.400 --> 11:56.680
I'm their live-in husband.

11:56.760 --> 11:58.000
Her mother has the final say

11:58.080 --> 11:59.280
about the choice
of her live-in son-in-law.

12:00.880 --> 12:02.440
He is good at putting on an act.

12:02.520 --> 12:04.480
It's hard to tell whether his words
and actions are true or false.

12:04.560 --> 12:06.240
Don't let him fool you.

12:07.880 --> 12:08.720
Look at them.

12:08.800 --> 12:09.840
Do you still think

12:10.560 --> 12:12.080
I'm putting on an act now?

12:18.160 --> 12:20.840
When they first came to our village,

12:20.920 --> 12:23.280
this girl simply wouldn't let go
of his hand.

12:23.360 --> 12:25.760
I asked her if he was her husband.

12:25.840 --> 12:28.040
However, she said no.

12:28.120 --> 12:31.280
It's like birds of the same kind
live together.

12:31.360 --> 12:32.360
You are both good at putting on an act.

12:33.160 --> 12:35.120
Am I right?

12:35.200 --> 12:37.200
Yes.

12:37.280 --> 12:38.720
You are right.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.400
I can put on an act, too.

12:42.040 --> 12:44.040
You brat are being naughty again.
I'll beat you.

12:44.760 --> 12:45.720
Stop there!

12:46.360 --> 12:49.240
- Wei, get us some more wine.
- Okay.

12:51.440 --> 12:52.280
Can I talk to her?

12:54.720 --> 12:56.200
- Mei Lin.
- Madam.

12:56.280 --> 12:57.880
Tell me the truth.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.920
Are you satisfied with your husband?

13:07.520 --> 13:10.320
He has many shortcomings,

13:12.520 --> 13:13.520
but he is a good guy.

13:20.960 --> 13:22.040
He…

13:24.120 --> 13:25.440
He treats me very well.

13:27.080 --> 13:28.400
He's willing to give in after an argument.

13:30.800 --> 13:31.760
He…

13:34.040 --> 13:35.720
Anyway, my mother should be satisfied
with him.

13:36.320 --> 13:38.880
I'm asking you.
Why do you talk about your mother?

13:41.440 --> 13:43.080
My mother is satisfied.

13:44.440 --> 13:45.280
So am I.

13:46.120 --> 13:47.800
You girl!

14:15.840 --> 14:18.320
- Is that true?
- What?

14:18.400 --> 14:20.480
Is what you just said true?

14:20.560 --> 14:24.040
Are you willing to take me, Murong Jinghe,

14:24.720 --> 14:25.680
as your live-in husband?

14:29.960 --> 14:31.560
I'm not good at making up stories

14:32.720 --> 14:34.280
or putting on an act.

14:34.880 --> 14:36.360
Every word I say is true.

14:37.800 --> 14:38.640
Don't bite me.

15:16.560 --> 15:17.680
What are you doing?

15:23.600 --> 15:24.440
We…

15:27.960 --> 15:28.800
We are catching fireflies.

15:31.320 --> 15:33.880
Sir, please take me with you.

15:33.960 --> 15:35.080
Where to?

15:35.160 --> 15:36.720
To the outside world. I hate to be beaten.

15:36.800 --> 15:39.280
I don't want to stay
in the Laowozi Village anymore.

15:41.400 --> 15:42.720
Erniu,

15:43.720 --> 15:46.320
there are many ferocious beasts outside.
They eat people.

15:46.920 --> 15:48.480
Your mother beats you
because she wants to protect you.

15:48.560 --> 15:50.480
Home is the safest place.

15:50.560 --> 15:52.400
Why don't you go home?

15:53.200 --> 15:55.480
- Because we…
- Because her parents

15:55.560 --> 15:58.480
were eaten
by a ferocious man-eating beast.

15:58.560 --> 16:01.320
So, we need to go outside
to catch that ferocious beast.

16:02.080 --> 16:04.360
Only then can I give her a new home.

16:05.040 --> 16:07.400
Sir, you must catch that ferocious beast.

16:08.280 --> 16:09.240
Don't worry.

16:10.120 --> 16:11.880
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

17:14.319 --> 17:15.160
I am really

17:16.720 --> 17:18.760
not worth you wasting
any more effort on me.

17:22.160 --> 17:24.480
Your Highness,
His Majesty's Imperial Guards

17:24.560 --> 17:26.280
have been following us secretly.

17:26.359 --> 17:28.079
Fortunately, Your Highness
made preparations in advance.

17:28.160 --> 17:30.000
With the excuse
of seeking the culprit Mei Lin,

17:30.080 --> 17:31.320
we can cover it up.

17:31.400 --> 17:33.560
It's just that
with the Imperial Guards around,

17:33.640 --> 17:35.400
we face many constraints in our actions.

17:35.480 --> 17:39.200
It'll be harder to find Prince Jing.

17:39.280 --> 17:40.920
Even if Prince Jing comes back,

17:41.560 --> 17:43.200
the throne may not necessarily be his.

17:44.120 --> 17:45.200
But Luomei

17:46.840 --> 17:48.040
must be mine.

17:53.000 --> 17:56.400
I want Father to grant me
the marriage of Luomei.

17:57.840 --> 17:59.880
But how can His Majesty agree
to let Your Highness marry

17:59.960 --> 18:02.080
a Crown Princess who holds military power?

18:02.160 --> 18:03.960
Besides, General Yin is…

18:04.040 --> 18:05.600
It depends on what we make of it.

18:06.240 --> 18:07.680
They have no other choice.

18:13.680 --> 18:15.320
Send this to the Fengyi Palace.

18:29.640 --> 18:32.720
I heard my aunt's headache
is getting more and more serious.

18:33.280 --> 18:34.960
Her Highness' headache stems
from emotional distress.

18:35.040 --> 18:37.240
Her Highness is worried
about your marriage,

18:37.320 --> 18:39.320
but you are solely focused
on military affairs

18:39.400 --> 18:40.440
and show no interest in getting married.

18:41.560 --> 18:44.480
This dress was custom-made for you
by the best embroiderer

18:44.560 --> 18:46.120
in the tailor's workshop
at Her Highness's request.

18:46.200 --> 18:48.440
If you are willing to wear
women's clothing for Her Highness,

18:48.520 --> 18:51.360
it will alleviate
her headache considerably.

18:53.560 --> 18:56.040
- Okay.
- Thank you, General.

19:39.600 --> 19:41.040
Luomei, are you alright?

20:01.680 --> 20:02.520
Luomei.

21:04.600 --> 21:05.640
Luomei.

21:16.800 --> 21:17.840
Wait.

22:34.600 --> 22:35.800
I crossed the line just now.

22:37.360 --> 22:38.400
My aunt did this.

22:39.400 --> 22:41.360
She wants to force His Majesty
to grant the marriage.

22:41.440 --> 22:42.680
General,

22:43.440 --> 22:46.320
just forget about what happened today.

22:46.400 --> 22:47.760
Don't feel pressured.

22:51.000 --> 22:53.840
Your Majesty, Fengyi Palace
has just collected lotus dew today.

22:54.640 --> 22:55.760
It's best for making tea.

22:58.400 --> 22:59.960
Stay here. I'll deal with this.

23:04.200 --> 23:07.080
Luomei, don't worry. I got this.

23:17.720 --> 23:20.320
FENGYI PALACE

23:23.760 --> 23:25.000
Father. Your Highness.

23:27.080 --> 23:28.960
Your Highness, where is Luomei?

23:29.040 --> 23:30.920
Did you see her?

23:31.000 --> 23:33.240
No. Maybe I missed her.

23:36.480 --> 23:38.160
Why are you here?

23:39.840 --> 23:41.320
I heard Her Highness is sick.

23:41.400 --> 23:42.560
So, I've come to see her.

23:45.480 --> 23:48.600
Your Majesty,
I caught a cold at night recently.

23:49.320 --> 23:52.000
- I feel quite feeble.
- I'm getting better now.

23:52.080 --> 23:53.640
Your Majesty, please come in.

23:58.040 --> 24:00.640
I accidentally
broke Your Highness's screen.

24:00.720 --> 24:02.760
Please go to another place to have tea.

24:05.280 --> 24:06.400
Is Luomei inside?

24:08.400 --> 24:10.080
Is there anything we can't see?

24:11.520 --> 24:12.360
Xuanlie,

24:14.040 --> 24:14.880
go to Yanming Palace.

24:22.760 --> 24:24.160
Why did he change the plan?

24:40.800 --> 24:42.080
Luomei,

24:42.160 --> 24:43.840
- I…
- Actually, you didn't have to do this.

24:55.040 --> 24:57.640
Father, I want to marry Yin Luomei.

24:58.240 --> 24:59.840
Only she can be my Crown Princess.

24:59.920 --> 25:01.040
Rascal!

25:02.800 --> 25:05.080
Your third brother has just passed away.
How can you…

25:05.160 --> 25:06.560
The third Brother is dead.

25:07.120 --> 25:10.480
Father, how much longer
will you keep thinking about him?

25:12.240 --> 25:14.200
You! You did it!

25:16.680 --> 25:17.600
Yes.

25:18.480 --> 25:19.560
I hate him

25:20.320 --> 25:21.360
and I'm jealous of him.

25:22.040 --> 25:23.840
All the things I strive for so hard,

25:24.440 --> 25:27.840
including your favor
and Luomei's affection,

25:30.440 --> 25:31.800
have been obtained by him effortlessly.

25:34.680 --> 25:36.200
Yet he doesn't care at all.

25:40.440 --> 25:42.680
I wish I could kill him with my own hands.

25:43.800 --> 25:45.400
But if he had really died in my hands,

25:45.480 --> 25:47.800
it would ruin my reputation,
and I would have no chance

25:48.440 --> 25:49.960
to get what I want.

25:50.600 --> 25:53.200
You suspect me. I don't want to explain.

25:53.280 --> 25:55.160
After we find Mei Lin and interrogate her,

25:55.240 --> 25:56.800
the truth will be revealed.

25:58.320 --> 26:00.200
Everything was due to his own fault.

26:04.520 --> 26:05.600
Xuanlie,

26:06.400 --> 26:08.560
you've been sensible
since you were little.

26:09.400 --> 26:10.800
Your third brother was mischievous.

26:11.480 --> 26:12.920
When he got into trouble,
he'd seek your protection,

26:13.600 --> 26:15.040
and you'd protect him.

26:17.080 --> 26:19.840
I am aware that you suffered
many punishments because of this.

26:20.440 --> 26:22.320
I had thought that the two of you

26:22.400 --> 26:24.520
caring for each other was a good thing,

26:26.920 --> 26:29.000
but in the end,
it still caused you suffering.

26:30.400 --> 26:31.240
Father,

26:33.960 --> 26:36.040
if I can marry Luomei,

26:36.880 --> 26:38.200
all the suffering

26:39.680 --> 26:40.880
would not matter.

26:44.240 --> 26:45.840
You are the Crown Prince.

26:45.920 --> 26:47.360
You will take the throne

26:48.840 --> 26:50.120
and be the Emperor.

26:50.200 --> 26:52.040
In the future, you will take
this dragon throne

26:52.120 --> 26:53.920
and manage the affairs of the realm!

26:54.920 --> 26:56.520
Indulging in personal emotions

26:57.120 --> 26:59.000
will eventually lead to your downfall.

27:00.520 --> 27:02.440
I know what you are afraid of, Father.

27:03.680 --> 27:05.280
Holding military power
by relatives of the Empress

27:05.880 --> 27:07.480
has always been a great concern.

27:07.560 --> 27:09.560
I did not forget

27:10.560 --> 27:11.960
the lessons from the fall
of previous dynasties.

27:12.640 --> 27:15.160
You may not believe in the loyalty
of the Yin family,

27:15.240 --> 27:17.320
but you should at least trust me.

27:19.200 --> 27:20.920
I will not allow anyone

27:21.000 --> 27:23.600
to overthrow our Murong family's reign.

27:35.480 --> 27:37.240
But I have granted Luomei

27:38.960 --> 27:40.600
the freedom to choose a husband.

27:40.680 --> 27:43.000
Luomei will agree sooner or later.

27:44.640 --> 27:47.680
If I cannot even win her heart,

27:49.920 --> 27:51.240
how can I assure you

27:51.320 --> 27:53.640
that the Great Yan's reign
will remain secure?

28:08.720 --> 28:11.160
YANMING PALACE

28:16.080 --> 28:16.920
Your Highness,

28:17.520 --> 28:20.720
I bear the responsibility
of the Yin family and the Pingnan Army.

28:22.880 --> 28:24.800
It's okay now. Don't worry.

28:24.880 --> 28:27.040
No matter what my father says,

28:27.120 --> 28:28.840
just follow your heart.

28:31.440 --> 28:33.000
Actually, if my aunt hadn't done it,

28:33.760 --> 28:35.640
I would write your name
in the imperial edict

28:35.720 --> 28:37.160
for the arranged marriage.

28:41.120 --> 28:42.520
I am a martial artist.

28:43.200 --> 28:44.800
I don't quite understand love.

28:46.240 --> 28:47.800
But I will strive to reciprocate

28:50.720 --> 28:51.840
the genuine feelings you have shown me.

29:15.600 --> 29:18.040
Your Highness,
why did you change the plan?

29:19.080 --> 29:19.920
Your Highness,

29:20.640 --> 29:22.000
just now,

29:22.840 --> 29:23.920
Luomei agreed.

29:31.640 --> 29:33.640
That was a smart scheme of yours.

29:33.720 --> 29:35.600
You know how strong-willed Luomei is.

29:35.680 --> 29:38.400
Using an aphrodisiac to force
intercourse with her

29:38.480 --> 29:40.440
might provoke her rebellious nature.

29:41.200 --> 29:44.400
What I want has always been

29:45.520 --> 29:47.440
her willingness.

30:16.840 --> 30:19.520
Mr. Li, it's been a while.

30:25.480 --> 30:26.840
It's been a while.

30:30.120 --> 30:32.360
I can help you
bring down the Crown Prince.

30:33.240 --> 30:36.760
However, I need to meet your master first.

30:45.160 --> 30:47.200
Sir, His Majesty has withdrawn
all the Imperial Guards.

30:47.280 --> 30:49.440
Those who are watching us now
are all the Crown Prince's men.

30:50.040 --> 30:52.640
His Majesty wants to marry
General Yin into the Eastern Palace.

30:52.720 --> 30:55.920
It seems the Crown Prince
has dispelled His Majesty's doubts.

30:57.520 --> 30:59.680
Send a secret message to Prince Jing
and wait for his order.

30:59.760 --> 31:00.600
Yes.

31:06.320 --> 31:08.400
I guess I'll have to find my own way
back to the capital.

31:22.640 --> 31:25.120
Little drunkard, you can't drink anymore.

31:27.960 --> 31:29.200
I know my own condition.

31:31.240 --> 31:33.840
I'm happy these days. I want to drink.

31:42.080 --> 31:45.880
Well, after we leave Laowozi Village,

31:46.600 --> 31:48.600
will we have such happy days?

31:50.720 --> 31:52.240
As long as it's a day you enjoy,

31:53.240 --> 31:54.440
I am willing to spend it with you.

31:57.800 --> 31:59.520
Well? You don't believe it?

32:00.960 --> 32:03.880
Qingyan says in the letter
that Li Qing has been cured.

32:06.760 --> 32:09.360
We need to hurry back then.
There's no rush.

32:10.280 --> 32:11.840
Qingyan has been targeted.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.800
We may need to go back
to the capital by ourselves.

32:14.400 --> 32:16.000
It's going to be a rough trip.

32:16.080 --> 32:18.200
No trip can be more difficult
than the one in Zhongshan.

32:22.240 --> 32:25.160
Li Qing is now the key witness.

32:25.240 --> 32:26.840
Since he has been disposed of
after serving his purpose,

32:26.920 --> 32:28.520
he must hate the Crown Prince
even more than we do.

32:29.480 --> 32:31.400
In all, when we go back to the capital,

32:31.480 --> 32:32.680
we can bring down the Crown Prince.

32:37.640 --> 32:39.720
After we bring down the Crown Prince,

32:39.800 --> 32:41.520
when the situation is stable,

32:41.600 --> 32:43.040
we will go back to Qingzhou together.

32:44.640 --> 32:46.680
You'll open a fruit cake shop,

32:47.240 --> 32:49.000
and I'll be General Weibei.

32:49.840 --> 32:52.680
In times of leisure,
we'll paint and do what we like.

32:53.520 --> 32:56.640
In times of turmoil, we'll wield
our swords to defend the country.

32:57.480 --> 33:00.360
Would you like such a life?

33:04.560 --> 33:05.400
Yes.

33:26.960 --> 33:28.680
Come back if you encounter
any difficulties outside.

33:28.760 --> 33:29.600
Okay.

33:29.680 --> 33:31.560
Come back to see us when you can.

33:31.640 --> 33:32.480
Don't worry.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.240
These days…

33:34.320 --> 33:36.680
Erniu said you've been to the battlefield.

33:37.960 --> 33:39.080
I lied to him.

33:39.160 --> 33:41.200
I don't dare to kill a chicken.
How can I kill men?

33:41.280 --> 33:42.600
I dare

33:43.960 --> 33:44.880
to kill a chicken.

33:47.560 --> 33:48.400
Awesome.

33:48.920 --> 33:50.240
Jinghe,

33:50.840 --> 33:52.240
you wrote so many prescriptions for me.

33:52.320 --> 33:53.160
Here is your reward.

33:53.840 --> 33:55.440
Tianjing Grass can be eaten
and also used to treat illnesses.

33:55.520 --> 33:58.160
- It truly is a wonderful thing.
- Thank you, Doctor.

34:00.240 --> 34:02.200
It's getting late. Let's set off.

34:05.280 --> 34:06.440
Go ahead.

34:07.280 --> 34:08.520
Madam, we're leaving.

34:09.520 --> 34:10.600
Take care.

34:43.400 --> 34:44.239
There is someone behind us.

34:51.000 --> 34:52.120
Wei.

34:55.639 --> 34:57.400
I… I will go with you.

34:57.480 --> 34:58.440
I can protect you.

35:00.160 --> 35:01.680
Why do you think I can't protect her?

35:01.760 --> 35:04.160
You don't dare to kill a chicken,
but I dare.

35:07.000 --> 35:09.400
Wei, please go back.

35:09.480 --> 35:11.440
We can protect ourselves.

35:12.200 --> 35:13.320
I told you.

35:13.400 --> 35:15.640
Since you saved my life, I will repay you.

35:18.240 --> 35:20.320
I have great strength. I can help you.

35:29.160 --> 35:30.000
How is it?

35:31.080 --> 35:33.400
Wei, you can't survive outside

35:33.480 --> 35:36.160
relying solely on brute force.

35:39.640 --> 35:40.480
You are smart,

35:41.480 --> 35:42.840
so I'll follow you.

35:42.920 --> 35:44.360
I want to see the outside world, too.

35:49.920 --> 35:50.760
Wei,

35:51.560 --> 35:54.040
can you pull up that tree?

35:56.280 --> 35:57.200
That tree?

36:03.160 --> 36:04.240
I can.

36:23.480 --> 36:24.600
Let's go.

36:37.920 --> 36:39.360
Do you think he has gone back?

36:40.040 --> 36:43.040
Whether he goes back or not,
it's his choice.

36:43.120 --> 36:45.560
We don't need to worry about him.

36:50.920 --> 36:51.760
What are you picking?

36:53.800 --> 36:56.360
Red Fruit seeds. Don't you love them?

36:56.440 --> 36:57.680
I'll grow them for you when we're back.

36:59.480 --> 37:01.360
I've never seen these Red Fruits
in other places.

37:02.520 --> 37:05.920
Could it be they can only
grow in the soil here?

37:07.760 --> 37:08.600
It makes sense.

37:08.680 --> 37:10.440
Let's bring some soil back.

37:10.520 --> 37:12.280
The fruits will definitely taste the same.

37:18.440 --> 37:19.640
Let's make a bet.

37:20.480 --> 37:22.080
If I can grow Red Fruits,

37:23.120 --> 37:24.120
you will marry me.

37:27.200 --> 37:28.360
I won't make a bet with you.

37:29.040 --> 37:31.160
I won't be married off.
I'll just take a live-in husband.

37:34.040 --> 37:35.480
My family won't agree, I'm afraid.

37:38.640 --> 37:40.760
Unless you write a promise,

37:41.360 --> 37:42.440
stating that you will always
admit defeat first

37:42.520 --> 37:43.720
whenever we argue.

37:44.280 --> 37:46.000
Didn't you say you are willing
to lose to me forever?

37:46.080 --> 37:47.760
I'm willing to lose
to my princess forever.

37:50.440 --> 37:51.280
Liar.

37:52.440 --> 37:53.280
Alright now.

37:53.360 --> 37:55.360
Let's get married
when we return to Qingzhou.

37:55.440 --> 37:57.760
Anyway, Qingzhou is so far away.
My father can't interfere.

37:59.160 --> 38:00.760
You need to first grow the Red Fruits.

38:02.160 --> 38:03.400
Didn't you say you wouldn't
make a bet with me?

38:04.000 --> 38:04.840
It's too late now.

38:09.400 --> 38:10.880
Liar. Liar.

38:17.040 --> 38:18.080
Qingzhou.

38:26.560 --> 38:31.280
MEMORIAL TO EMPRESS DEJIA OF GREAT YAN

38:32.800 --> 38:33.640
Empress Dejia,

38:34.680 --> 38:36.440
I am indebted to you.

38:37.320 --> 38:40.520
As a father, I believed
I never owed Jinghe anything,

38:41.800 --> 38:43.520
but it turns out I ended up harming him.

38:44.280 --> 38:47.320
Maybe I shouldn't have
summoned Jinghe back to the capital.

38:47.400 --> 38:50.600
Everyone in the court believes that
I intended to change the heir.

38:52.800 --> 38:55.400
I am the one who made Jinghe a target.

38:56.520 --> 38:58.320
When it comes to the ruling,

38:59.000 --> 39:00.800
Jinghe fell short compared to Xuanlie.

39:01.960 --> 39:03.800
My choice was not wrong.

39:05.360 --> 39:07.320
I had given him a chance,

39:08.800 --> 39:10.120
but Qingzhou…

39:14.880 --> 39:15.920
As an Emperor,

39:18.240 --> 39:20.080
I treated him fairly.

39:23.560 --> 39:25.520
Now, Jinghe has been buried.

39:26.680 --> 39:28.800
As for who killed him,

39:30.760 --> 39:32.200
I don't want to know,

39:33.680 --> 39:35.480
and I don't have to know it.

39:36.240 --> 39:37.240
MEMORIAL TO EMPRESS DEJIA OF GREAT YAN

39:37.320 --> 39:38.320
Empress Dejia,

39:39.360 --> 39:40.600
when I first ascended the throne,

39:41.240 --> 39:43.040
your Yuchi family served with merit.

39:45.080 --> 39:46.600
Jinghe suffered such a calamity

39:47.400 --> 39:49.560
because I've broken my promise.

39:51.680 --> 39:53.040
I am indebted to you

39:55.040 --> 39:58.880
and the Yuchi family.

40:28.120 --> 40:29.240
Concubine Yan heard Your Majesty

40:29.320 --> 40:32.160
had withdrawn the Imperial Guards
searching for Mei Lin.

40:32.240 --> 40:33.560
Her Highness is worried.

40:34.160 --> 40:35.200
Tell Concubine Yan

40:36.040 --> 40:37.480
to consider Mei Lin already dead,

40:38.320 --> 40:39.800
and say that it is my order.

40:39.880 --> 40:40.800
Yes, Your Majesty.

40:44.240 --> 40:46.160
His Majesty has his own difficulties.

40:46.760 --> 40:48.560
I'll look for Mei Lin myself.

40:54.160 --> 40:56.200
The Prince Heir of Xiyan will arrive
in the capital soon.

40:57.600 --> 40:58.600
Tell Xuanlie to receive him.

40:58.680 --> 40:59.800
Yes, Your Majesty.

41:08.320 --> 41:10.640
My Lord, here is a message
from General Qingyan.

41:10.720 --> 41:11.840
On the day the Prince Heir of Xiyan
enters the capital, the Crown Prince

41:12.440 --> 41:14.240
will replace all the city gate guards
with the Eastern Palace's Xuantie Guards

41:14.320 --> 41:17.160
under the pretext of welcoming
the Prince Heir into the city.

41:17.240 --> 41:18.440
Set off immediately.

41:18.520 --> 41:20.080
Let's go back to the capital
before the Prince Heir of Xiyan.

41:41.520 --> 41:42.360
Your Highness.

41:48.640 --> 41:50.560
ZIGU

41:50.640 --> 41:53.040
Brother, Mei Lin is missing.

41:57.480 --> 41:58.320
Go ahead.

41:59.120 --> 42:00.160
Stop.

42:01.040 --> 42:02.280
Go.

42:17.360 --> 42:18.200
Stop the carriage.

42:20.200 --> 42:22.480
Officer, these are the herbs collected
by Yongtai Pharmacy.

42:22.560 --> 42:24.160
Yongtai Pharmacy belongs
to Jining Marquis.

42:25.160 --> 42:26.000
Look.

42:26.080 --> 42:27.800
Whoever you are, you have to be inspected.

42:27.880 --> 42:29.520
- Conduct the inspection!
- Yes.

42:37.520 --> 42:39.880
It seems we need to reconsider
how to enter the city.

42:44.400 --> 42:48.200
ZHAOJING

42:50.840 --> 42:52.640
When will the Prince Heir of Xiyan
arrive in the capital?

42:53.320 --> 42:54.880
Tomorrow at the earliest.

42:55.800 --> 42:57.520
It took him only a few months

42:57.600 --> 42:59.160
to ascend to the position
of the Prince Heir

42:59.240 --> 43:00.840
from being a Hostage Prince,

43:02.080 --> 43:04.760
whereas it has taken me over 20 years.

43:05.440 --> 43:06.760
This is truly shameful.

43:07.360 --> 43:08.840
Don't feel that way, Your Highness.

43:08.920 --> 43:11.920
Everybody knows he has become
the Prince Heir

43:12.000 --> 43:13.600
with the support
of the Emperor of Great Yan.

43:15.120 --> 43:17.520
From now on,
send the items to Concubine Yan

43:17.600 --> 43:18.520
according to the regulations
of Fengyi Palace.

43:19.120 --> 43:20.800
Your Highness, you are perhaps placing

43:20.880 --> 43:22.760
too much importance
on the Prince Heir of Xiyan.

43:24.640 --> 43:27.880
This pair of siblings is crucial
to the future of both countries.

43:27.960 --> 43:29.160
If we can draw them over to our side,

43:29.240 --> 43:30.600
it will not be a bad thing for us.

43:32.680 --> 43:33.560
Understood.

43:44.120 --> 43:45.280
My Lord.
